  "title": "Muffuletta",
  "description": "A kalamata and green olive mixture fills a hollowed loaf of Italian bread; add Genoa salami, provolone cheese, tomatoes and onions and you have one delicious sandwich. It needs to be made ahead of time to allow the flavors to blend.",
